# armour/shared/pauldron_plate4_l: the LARGE plate pauldron on the left shoulder (plate.4; LADDER-ARMOUR, STYLE_P2 25.6):
# the right one's cop and two lames, lit from the top-left as it falls on this side. Finish regions: R the hem, P the cop's
# face, N the seams, W a spot on the shadow side. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR i3) D U and the near side view redrawn: a raised haute-piece (the neck flange, R: gilt from T3) over the domed
# cop and a lit lame, inside the old box (origin a row lower for the flange); N dropped (runes live on the breastplate).
